Mplus VERSION 9 DEMO (Mac)
MUTHEN & MUTHEN
10/19/2026   9:47 PM

INPUT INSTRUCTIONS

  TITLE: Mplus Demo v9 runner comparison - LCGA K = 2, linear;
    class-specific time-invariant residual variance (fitLCGA);
    SYNTHETIC seeded data from validation/mplus/runner-mixtures-data.R. NOT a UG example.;
  DATA: FILE IS lcga.dat;
  VARIABLE:
    NAMES ARE y1-y4;
    CLASSES = c(2);
  ANALYSIS:
    TYPE = MIXTURE;
    STARTS = 400 100;
    STITERATIONS = 20;
    PROCESS = 1;
  MODEL:
    %OVERALL%
    i s | y1@0 y2@1 y3@2 y4@3;
    i-s@0;
    %c#1%
    y1-y4 (r1);
    %c#2%
    y1-y4 (r2);



*** WARNING in MODEL command
  All continuous latent variable covariances involving I have been fixed to 0
  because the variance of I is fixed at 0.
   1 WARNING(S) FOUND IN THE INPUT INSTRUCTIONS



